{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>There, tribes</b> — for they are the tribes of YHWH, a testimony, a statute, and a commandment to come three times, and they would praise YHWH when they saw the kingdom of David enduring. And if this psalm is about Solomon, the thrones will be for Solomon and his brothers, and if for the future, for the messiah and his sons."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 122, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:10.712404530Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}